# Which animal has the longest pregnancy?
subtitle: "Rank five animals by pregnancy length, from the elephant's two years to the hamster's sixteen days, and see why size sets the clock."

## Which animal has the longest pregnancy?
affirm: playful
sources:
    - id: gest
      title: List of mammalian gestation durations
      authors: Wikipedia
      year: 2025
      url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mammalian_gestation_durations
      finding: African elephant about 22 months, giraffe about 15 months, human about 9 months, dog about 63 days, golden hamster about 16 days

    cards preg cites ["gest"] ends ["longest","shortest"] hidden true
        * "Elephant" icon.of elephant icon.set twemoji
        * "Giraffe" icon.of giraffe icon.set twemoji
        * "Human" icon.of baby icon.set twemoji
        * "Dog" icon.of "dog face" icon.set twemoji
        * "Hamster" icon.of hamster icon.set twemoji
    text nm0 "Elephant" x 115 y 580 font_size 40 hidden true
    path bar0 closed #b5482e points [[265,552],[615,552],[615,608],[265,608]] style.fill #b5482e style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.4 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    text val0 "22 months" #b5482e x 700 y 580 font_size 36 hidden true
    text nm1 "Giraffe" x 115 y 490 font_size 40 hidden true
    path bar1 closed #2f6b8f points [[265,462],[503.6,462],[503.6,518],[265,518]] style.fill #2f6b8f style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.4 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    text val1 "15 months" #2f6b8f x 588.6 y 490 font_size 36 hidden true
    text nm2 "Human" x 115 y 400 font_size 40 hidden true
    path bar2 closed #2f6b8f points [[265,372],[408.2,372],[408.2,428],[265,428]] style.fill #2f6b8f style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.4 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    text val2 "9 months" #2f6b8f x 493.2 y 400 font_size 36 hidden true
    text nm3 "Dog" x 115 y 310 font_size 40 hidden true
    path bar3 closed #2f6b8f points [[265,282],[297.9,282],[297.9,338],[265,338]] style.fill #2f6b8f style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.4 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    text val3 "2 months" #2f6b8f x 382.9 y 310 font_size 36 hidden true
    text nm4 "Hamster" x 115 y 220 font_size 40 hidden true
    path bar4 closed #2f6b8f points [[265,192],[273.4,192],[273.4,248],[265,248]] style.fill #2f6b8f style.fill_style wash style.opacity 0.4 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    text val4 "16 days" #2f6b8f x 358.4 y 220 font_size 36 hidden true
    text calf "calf: 100 kg" #b5482e x 862 y 580 font_size 28 hidden true
    icon ic0 size 62 set twemoji x 225 y 580 icon_look picture of elephant hidden true
    icon ic1 size 62 set twemoji x 225 y 490 icon_look picture of giraffe hidden true
    icon ic2 size 62 set twemoji x 225 y 400 icon_look picture of baby hidden true
    icon ic3 size 62 set twemoji x 225 y 310 icon_look picture of "dog face" hidden true
    icon ic4 size 62 set twemoji x 225 y 220 icon_look picture of hamster hidden true

    card title "Which pregnancy lasts longest?"

Which of these animals carries its baby the longest before it is born?
    draw preg

    ask "Put them in order of how long a pregnancy lasts, the longest first." on preg store p
        right: You got {p}.
        wrong: You got {p}.

    hide preg

The champion is the elephant: about twenty-two months, almost two years.
    group row0 members ["nm0","ic0","bar0","val0"]

A giraffe takes about fifteen months, and its calf arrives with a drop of about one and a half metres to the ground.
    group row1 members ["nm1","ic1","bar1","val1"]

We come third, with nine months.
    group row2 members ["nm2","ic2","bar2","val2"]

Then a big drop: a dog needs only about two months.
    group row3 members ["nm3","ic3","bar3","val3"]

And a golden hamster just sixteen days, one of the shortest of any mammal.
    group row4 members ["nm4","ic4","bar4","val4"]

So why does the elephant wait so long? It (@draw calf@)s calf is born big, at about a hundred kilograms.

And it is born ready: within hours it stands, and soon walks with the herd.
    text stand "stands in hours" #b5482e x 830 y 490 font_size 28

On the open savanna, a baby that cannot keep up does not survive. So the long wait pays.
    highlight bar0 effect circle
---
